# San Antonio Cultural Event Lead Scout

Use this skill when the user wants to discover local markets, pop-ups, festivals, fundraisers, cultural events, corporate parties, Quinceañeras, prom committees, or UTSA alumni/tailgate events that may need a photo activation.

Follow `SKILL.md` for discovery, extraction, qualification, scoring, source attribution, outreach drafting, and privacy-safe research requirements.
